# Field access and indexing need `dynamic`, which is M2.
mode: check
schema: 'orders.csv'(orderId: string, customerId: string, amount: real, qty: long, small: int, timestamp: datetime, wait: timespan, shipped: bool)
---- query
from 'orders.csv' | where orderId.length > 1;
from 'orders.csv' | where orderId[0] == "o"
---- expected
error[DS2012]: field access needs a `dynamic` value
  --> query:1:27
  |
1 | from 'orders.csv' | where orderId.length > 1;
  |                           ^^^^^^^ this is `string`
  |
  = note: `dynamic` values are not available yet; they are planned for M2

error[DS2012]: indexing needs a `dynamic` value
  --> query:2:27
  |
2 | from 'orders.csv' | where orderId[0] == "o"
  |                           ^^^^^^^ this is `string`
  |
  = note: `dynamic` values are not available yet; they are planned for M2
